<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-25T17:08:15.249Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:08:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have recently attacked villages in northeast and eastern Nigeria, killing at least ten civilians and looting shops, and a separate assault on a village after Friday prayers left twenty dead, later rising to forty. In Plateau, bandits attacked women harvesting groundnuts, killing a woman and injuring two farmers. Community hunters in Katsina killed fourteen suspected bandits and disrupted a kidnap plot, while hunters elsewhere also killed fourteen suspected bandits. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE42RENQLVk0SzNyNjZPTmdZelUyWVM4ZjdhaDhwZmZGQUJsbXR4R2hieTduR25WY0V3ZkJVMWF0SHZ3VXg2WHVkS3REcUNnbmdHajE3NG5RRzkzRkdUM3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPT2RuS0w4RWVyZTBfLWd5LXNtYTZJWlFqWm5Va0dtT2ZzMXl3TDVYZjBUbUNoUXNfVXZCUDBoTXFoXzFsZnJoRnlsbTRvQVotS3pfN2J5dEJvanFsVXFES204ZTRSblQzWUdmbDJqNnhyV1VoSklnWE1GclZsWjIxeFdGV3ZSMjNTRC1PTnkydjE2RnlJTEgwZmVjbFVzdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQQTQxQ09zYkJLMkZPT2lUa3JWU0N6WXM1Yl9IZ2h1Wm5fU3NHWFBfZ2tCTFdUcEJKdUtfUUxZRG1yVTBfWFJrc20wWFlUbjM2UUcwS0I0VkY1ODBTQzNnVGRsWUFYTVVjLTNjaF9vX1dhTmx1dnA4S3BTdWQyaXlRQ0VBZDJtZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPamQ0RklzRmV